  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Crimson Reed Marsh he stands beside that Eastern Sea guest, who controls the glass sea, praises Qin Bai Sheng’s auction as a method of self-protection, and answers the guest with open respect.",
      "chapters": [
        747
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crimson_reed_marsh",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He and the Eastern Sea rank eight take the first secret room and hide their identities while they bid.",
      "chapters": [
        753
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-secret-room",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After He Lang Zi learns that Ascending Heaven Plain lies in Eastern Sea, Murong Jin Xiao thanks the guest for help that left He Lang Zi unable to go there.",
      "chapters": [
        752
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-secret-room",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "loc_ascending_heaven_plain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Asked how many refinement path grandmasters Northern Plains has, he answers at once: Yao Huang of Yao tribe, Murong Xue Xiang of Murong tribe, Lady Wan Shou of Snowy Mountain, and the lone cultivator Lady Miao Li.",
      "chapters": [
        753
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-secret-room",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_yao_huang",
        "fac_yao_tribe",
        "char_xue_xiang",
        "fac_murong_tribe",
        "char_lady_wan_shou",
        "loc_snowy_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the late bidding the Eastern Sea guest urges him to let go and promises compensation, because that force has no Immortal Gu House. Murong Jin Xiao refuses: Murong tribe’s Immortal Gu House lacks a core Immortal Gu, the stake is huge for the tribe, and he will fight for it whether he succeeds or fails.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "red-fiend-divine-boat-bid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
